WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
It's not your country, my friend.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.040
It's our country, whether you like it or not.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.840
I thought Kai was, he smiled, he laughed, he disagreed.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.719
I felt like it was good faith.

00:00:17.719 --> 00:00:18.559
Let's see.

00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:19.379
I appreciate it, man.

00:00:19.379 --> 00:00:21.040
He seemed to be in good faith.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.740
He seems kind of smart.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.879
And you know, he's one of the few people

00:00:24.879 --> 00:00:26.600
who doesn't want to deport me.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.520
Or maybe not.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.100
We're going to find out.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.740
My claim is we should get rid of birthright citizenship.

